    "description": "Instant ad, a platform for buying and selling, and the program for publishing ads and the need to buy and sell new and second-hand goods, real estate ads, buying and selling cars, goods, employment and job ads, service ads.\r\n\r\nInstant advertisement to activate the business panel\r\nMaster craftsmen \r\nSellers\r\n_ Real estate consultants\r\n_ Car consultants\r\nInstitutions, schools, etc\r\n\r\nSome categories:\r\n\r\nVehicles: buying and selling passenger cars, classic and heavy cars and rental car advertisements\r\n\r\nProperties:\r\nBuying and selling houses, mortgages and renting apartments, villas and shops...\r\n\r\nElectronic devices: buying and selling mobile phones and tablets, laptops and computers, game consoles, audio and video equipment, etc.\r\n\r\nHome appliances: buying and selling of home appliances, kitchen appliances, building tools and equipment, construction supplies...\r\n\r\nServices: all kinds of catering and ceremony services, cleaning, entertainment, computer, financial and accounting services, etc.\r\n\r\nPersonal items: buying and selling bags, shoes, clothes, cosmetics, baby clothes, stationery, etc.\r\n\r\nEntertainment and leisure: buying and selling tickets and tours, musical instruments, books and magazines, collections, musical instruments, sports equipment, etc.\r\n\r\nRecruitment and job search: administrative and managerial, janitorial, civil and construction, computer and information technology, finance and accounting, etc.",
